# Playground sessions database and images, when `playground_store` is set to a
# relative path or a test leaves one behind. The shipped default puts the store
# beside `server-config.json`, not here. Anchored on purpose:
# `src/dashboard/src/playground/` is source, and a bare `playground/` would
# swallow it.
